====================================================================================================
(b2) on-shell 3-graviton kinematics for collinear real momenta: all building blocks vanish
====================================================================================================
  max |k_i.k_j| = 1.2e-15; max |eps_i.k_j| = 3.2e-16; max |<ij>| = 1.0e-15
  -> the cubic vertex (two derivatives, contracted from k_i.k_j, eps.k, eps.eps) vanishes on this support;
     the 3-point on-shell amplitude M3 ~ kappa <12>^6/(<23><31>)^2 (or [..]) is 0 for real collinear momenta.

