  theta12= 0.10: s = 9.992e-03; max |M| over helicities/angles = 2.4614e-01;  max|M|/(8 pi s) = 0.980166
  theta12= 0.03: s = 8.999e-04; max |M| over helicities/angles = 2.2169e-02;  max|M|/(8 pi s) = 0.980166
  theta12= 0.01: s = 1.000e-04; max |M| over helicities/angles = 2.4634e-03;  max|M|/(8 pi s) = 0.980166
  -> |M| <= 8 pi G s -> 0 at s = 0 (independent bound: |t|, |u| <= s so 8 pi G t^2/s <= 8 pi G s).
